<Base pageKey="service-digital-branding">
<main>
<section data-hero="" data-pad="" style="position:relative;overflow:hidden;padding:110px 72px 90px;max-width:1440px;margin:0 auto;text-align:center;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center">
  <div data-art-id="create-service-branding" data-art="create-service-branding" data-art-slot="" style="position:absolute;left:50%;top:-180px;transform:translateX(-50%);width:820px;height:820px;border-radius:50%;overflow:hidden;background:#0B0B0E;border:1px solid rgba(248,250,252,.07);display:flex;align-items:flex-end;pointer-events:none"><Artwork id="create-service-branding" />
    <div data-art-note="" data-art-label="" style="position:absolute;left:0;top:0;box-sizing:border-box;display:flex;padding:14px 18px;border-radius:12px;background:rgba(9,9,11,.82);border:1px solid rgba(248,250,252,.14);flex-direction:column;gap:6px;max-width:520px">
      <span style="font-family:Inter,system-ui,sans-serif;font-weight:500;font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.2em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#8B5CF6">ARTWORK — DIGITAL BRANDING</span>
      <span style="font-family:Inter,system-ui,sans-serif;font-weight:500;font-size:9.5px;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#71717A">Artwork Placeholder</span>
      <span style="font-family:Inter,system-ui,sans-serif;font-size:11px;line-height:1.6;color:#52525B">1:1 · centred · transparency required · 15% clear margin</span>
      <span style="font-family:Inter,system-ui,sans-serif;font-size:10.5px;line-height:1.6;color:#3F3F46">Final artwork supplied separately</span>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div style="position:relative;z-index:2;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:22px;max-width:760px;align-items:center">
    <div style="font-family:Inter,system-ui,sans-serif;font-weight:500;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.22em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#8B5CF6">Digital branding</div>
    <h1 data-h1="" style="margin:0;font-family:Sora,sans-serif;font-size:64px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-0.035em;line-height:1.03">A brand is more than how a business looks. It is how it becomes recognisable.</h1>
    <p data-lead="" style="margin:0;font-size:18px;line-height:1.7;color:#A1A1AA;max-width:600px">Digital Branding gives a business the visual and verbal foundation to present itself the same way twice. Create Studio builds identity systems connecting positioning, logo usage, typography, colour, imagery and application across every digital touchpoint.</p>
    <p style="margin:0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.8;color:#52525B;max-width:600px">Deliverables depend on the selected package and the approved project scope.</p>
    <div data-row="" style="display:flex;gap:14px;margin-top:8px"><a href="/contact" data-route="contact" data-btn-primary="" style="padding:16px 30px;border-radius:999px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#2563FF,#8B5CF6,#2563FF);font-weight:600;font-size:15px;transition:transform .25s ease,box-shadow .25s ease;text-align:center" data-sh="5">Start a Project</a><a href="/work" data-route="work" data-btn-ghost="" style="padding:16px 30px;border-radius:999px;border:1px solid rgba(248,250,252,.16);font-weight:500;font-size:15px;transition:background .25s ease,border-color .25s ease;text-align:center" data-sh="6">See Our Work</a></div>
    <p style="margin:14px 0 0;font-size:13px;line-height:1.8;color:#52525B;max-width:640px;text-align:center">Each package states clearly whether it provides a focused visual identity or a more complete brand system. Trademark registration, naming clearance, printing, photography, copywriting and social-media management are not included.</p>
  </div>
</section>
<section data-sect="" data-pad="" style="max-width:1440px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 72px 100px;"><div data-cols="" style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1.15fr;gap:70px;align-items:start">
  <div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px"><div style="font-family:Inter,system-ui,sans-serif;font-weight:500;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.22em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#8B5CF6">The problem</div><h2 data-h2="" data-rv="" style="margin:0;font-family:Sora,sans-serif;font-size:38px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:-0.03em;line-height:1.1">The logo is fine. Everything around it is improvised.</h2></div>
  <div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:18px"><p style="margin:0;font-size:16px;line-height:1.8;color:#A1A1AA">A logo made once, then colours picked per post, three fonts across four documents, and a website that looks unrelated to the Instagram account. Each piece is defensible; together they read as a business that has not decided who it is.</p><p style="margin:0;font-size:16px;line-height:1.8;color:#A1A1AA">Consistency is what makes a small business look established. It is also the cheapest advantage available, because it costs decisions rather than budget.</p></div>
</div></section>
<section data-sect="" data-pad="" style="max-width:1440px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 72px 100px;"><div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:28px;padding:48px;border-radius:28px;background:#0B0B0E;border:1px solid rgba(248,250,252,.08)">
  <div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px;max-width:660px"><div style="font-family:Inter,system-ui,sans-serif;font-weight:500;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.22em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#8B5CF6">Our solution</div><h2 data-h2="" data-rv="" style="margin:0;font-family:Sora,sans-serif;font-size:36px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:-0.03em;line-height:1.12">Decide once. Write it down. Apply it everywhere.</h2><p style="margin:0;font-size:15.5px;line-height:1.8;color:#A1A1AA">Positioning and visual direction are settled first. Then the logo system, the colour and type rules — and finally the documentation, so every future piece starts from the same place instead of from a blank page.</p></div>
  <div data-cols="" style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:10px 32px;padding-top:26px;border-top:1px solid rgba(248,250,252,.08)"><div style="display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start;font-size:13.5px;color:#A1A1AA;line-height:1.55"><span style="width:5px;height:5px;border-radius:99px;background:#8B5CF6;margin-top:7px;flex:none"></span><span>Brand strategy</span></div><div style="display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start;font-size:13.5px;color:#A1A1AA;line-height:1.55"><span style="width:5px;height:5px;border-radius:99px;background:#8B5CF6;margin-top:7px;flex:none"></span><span>Positioning</span></div><div style="display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start;font-size:13.5px;color:#A1A1AA;line-height:1.55"><span style="width:5px;height:5px;border-radius:99px;background:#8B5CF6;margin-top:7px;flex:none"></span><span>Visual direction</span></div><div style="display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start;font-size:13.5px;color:#A1A1AA;line-height:1.55"><span style="width:5px;height:5px;border-radius:99px;background:#8B5CF6;margin-top:7px;flex:none"></span><span>Logo system</span></div><div style="display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start;font-size:13.5px;color:#A1A1AA;line-height:1.55"><span style="width:5px;height:5px;border-radius:99px;background:#8B5CF6;margin-top:7px;flex:none"></span><span>Colour palette</span></div><div style="display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start;font-size:13.5px;color:#A1A1AA;line-height:1.55"><span style="width:5px;height:5px;border-radius:99px;background:#8B5CF6;margin-top:7px;flex:none"></span><span>Typography</span></div><div style="display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start;font-size:13.5px;color:#A1A1AA;line-height:1.55"><span style="width:5px;height:5px;border-radius:99px;background:#8B5CF6;margin-top:7px;flex:none"></span><span>Digital brand guidelines</span></div><div style="display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start;font-size:13.5px;color:#A1A1AA;line-height:1.55"><span style="width:5px;height:5px;border-radius:99px;background:#8B5CF6;margin-top:7px;flex:none"></span><span>Social-media direction</span></div><div style="display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start;font-size:13.5px;color:#A1A1AA;line-height:1.55"><span style="width:5px;height:5px;border-radius:99px;background:#8B5CF6;margin-top:7px;flex:none"></span><span>Website application</span></div><div style="display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start;font-size:13.5px;color:#A1A1AA;line-height:1.55"><span style="width:5px;height:5px;border-radius:99px;background:#8B5CF6;margin-top:7px;flex:none"></span><span>Launch resources</span></div><div style="display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start;font-size:13.5px;color:#A1A1AA;line-height:1.55"><span style="width:5px;height:5px;border-radius:99px;background:#8B5CF6;margin-top:7px;flex:none"></span><span>Template starters</span></div><div style="display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start;font-size:13.5px;color:#A1A1AA;line-height:1.55"><span style="width:5px;height:5px;border-radius:99px;background:#8B5CF6;margin-top:7px;flex:none"></span><span>Asset library</span></div></div>
  <div style="font-size:13px;color:#A1A1AA;line-height:1.7">We do not present invented client logos or fabricated brand walls. Every example shown is real work.</div>
</div></section>
<section data-sect="" data-pad="" style="max-width:1440px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 72px 100px;"><div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:26px"><div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px"><div style="font-family:Inter,system-ui,sans-serif;font-weight:500;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.22em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#8B5CF6">How the work runs</div><h2 data-h2="" data-rv="" style="margin:0;font-family:Sora,sans-serif;font-size:34px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:-0.03em">Strategy, then form, then documentation.</h2></div><div data-cols="" style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(5,1fr);gap:16px"><div style="padding:24px;border-radius:18px;background:#0E0E12;border:1px solid rgba(248,250,252,.08);display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px"><div style="font-family:Inter,system-ui,sans-serif;font-weight:500;font-size:11px;color:#8B5CF6">01</div><h3 style="margin:0;font-family:Sora,sans-serif;font-size:16.5px;font-weight:600">Positioning</h3><p style="margin:0;font-size:12.5px;color:#A1A1AA;line-height:1.6">Audience, promise, personality and tone.</p></div><div style="padding:24px;border-radius:18px;background:#0E0E12;border:1px solid rgba(248,250,252,.08);display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px"><div style="font-family:Inter,system-ui,sans-serif;font-weight:500;font-size:11px;color:#8B5CF6">02</div><h3 style="margin:0;font-family:Sora,sans-serif;font-size:16.5px;font-weight:600">Direction</h3><p style="margin:0;font-size:12.5px;color:#A1A1AA;line-height:1.6">Visual territory explored and agreed.</p></div><div style="padding:24px;border-radius:18px;background:#0E0E12;border:1px solid rgba(248,250,252,.08);display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px"><div style="font-family:Inter,system-ui,sans-serif;font-weight:500;font-size:11px;color:#8B5CF6">03</div><h3 style="margin:0;font-family:Sora,sans-serif;font-size:16.5px;font-weight:600">System</h3><p style="margin:0;font-size:12.5px;color:#A1A1AA;line-height:1.6">Logo, colour, type and layo